        "quote": "(a) No pawnbroker shall contract for, charge or receive, directly or indirectly or in connection with any pawnbroker transaction, any charges, whether for interest, storage, insurance, service fee, handling, compensation, consideration or expense, which in the aggregate are greater than the charges provided and authorized by this chapter. Any other provisions of law relating to interest, storage and such charges as stated in this section shall not be applicable to any pawnbroker transaction made in accordance with this chapter.",
